  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fHjXSJ2/One-Pink-Block.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1129\" height=\"89\"></span></span></strong></span></h2><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這是一張類似於 <em>IJAMinecraft</em> 的 <strong>OneBlock</strong> 地圖的冒險地圖。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在這張地圖中，你將會以一個懸浮在虛空之上的單一方塊出現。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你將永遠敲擊一個<strong>&nbsp;粉紅幸運方塊</strong>！祝你好運！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/P4tZPcx/Untitled-1.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"519\" height=\"292\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎來到 <em><strong>幸運一粉塊！</strong></em></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這張《Minecraft》地圖將帶領你踏上一場圍繞著</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">一個 <em><strong>單一方塊</strong></em> 的<strong>粉紅</strong><em><strong>幸運方塊</strong></em> 的刺激且富有挑戰性的冒險。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">準備好體驗充滿 <strong>驚喜</strong>、<strong>危險</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">與 <strong>機會</strong> 的旅程，探索一個獨特而有限的世界。</span></p><hr><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/yNV3G1N/2023-07-13-23-37-01.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"321\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4YQSMmq/This-map-requiere-mod.png\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-block</a> <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">1.16.5 - 1.20.2</span></em></span><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modern-lucky-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modern-lucky-block</a>&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">1.20.6-1.21.3</span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/82Bn5Sx/This-Map-requieres-the-addons.png\" width=\"840\" height=\"46\"><br>粉紅<em>&nbsp;幸運方塊</em>:<br><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:12px\"><a style=\"color:#000\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/lucky-block-pink\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/lucky-block-pink</a></span></span></strong></span><br><br></h2><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthisboy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">按此獲得 25% 折扣</span></a></span><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthisboy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e786a9cc-b379-4f61-b906-ed81aeb57024.png\" width=\"1351\" height=\"224\"></a></h2><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>我的 Discord：</em></strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/B9rysAEFGk\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Discord-logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"427\" height=\"240\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
